EVALUATION PROTOCOL
-------------------
Dataset             Paper30 (30 scenes)
GT source           imaginarium_3d_scene_layout_dataset/*_detect_items.pkl
Visible mask filter min-visible-mask-area = 8000 px
Visible bbox filter min-visible-bbox-size = 0 px
Pose alignment      Scene-level translation/rotation recovery evaluation
Primary metrics     Recovery, Parent Accuracy, Rotation AUC@60deg,
                    Translation AUC@0.5m

