------------------------------------------------
Common source       v4_deepsearch S3 geometry and source-S3 locked camera
Reference version   v5_sceneproof_collision_partial_commit_certified_paper30_fix61
Final method        v5_sceneproof_vertical_support_visual_paper30_fix114
