PAPER30 PRIMARY QUALITY -- V5-FAST FIX121 (2026-08-12)
------------------------------------------------------
Protocol                             Paper30; visible mask >= 8000 px;
                                     Primary objects; aligned pose metrics
Version                recovery     parent      rot AUC@60   trans AUC@0.5m  physical macro
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
v1                     89.49%       89.32%      48.13%       23.73%           52.98%
v4-deepsearch          88.22%       80.14%      31.34%       12.19%           54.58%
V5-fast / Fix61        88.22%       80.14%      31.38%       12.14%           62.10%

Interpretation:
  - Primary recovery and parent are unchanged from v4-deepsearch to V5-fast.
  - V5-fast vs v4-deepsearch: rotation +0.035 percentage points and
    translation -0.055 percentage points; both are effectively preserved.
  - V5-fast S4 (Fix61): 192.930 s/scene, 1.608 GPU-hours, 3.513x.
  - V5-medium adds Fix114 166.333 s/scene: final S4 359.263 s/scene,
    2.994 GPU-hours, 1.887x. Final 256-sample rendering is separate: 415.570 s
    two-A10 wall time.
  - Cold S0-S3: 636.949 s/scene, 5.308 GPU-hours; measured two-A10 wall
    9649.662 s (2.680 h).
    Stage means: S0=9.687 s (1.52%), S1=443.036 s (69.56%),
    S2=137.451 s (21.58%), S3=44.790 s (7.03%), overhead=1.986 s (0.31%).
    Accounting closure error: -0.000000 s. Main full-chain bottleneck: S1.
  - V5-fast S0-S4: 829.879 s/scene, 6.916 GPU-hours, ideal 3.458 h/2A10.
  - V5-medium S0-S4: 996.212 s/scene, 8.302 GPU-hours, ideal 4.151 h/2A10.
  - Physical macro improves by +7.51 percentage points over v4-deepsearch.
  - The large v1 -> v4-deepsearch pose drop predates SceneProof support repair
    and therefore is not caused by the V5 support mechanism.
  - Missing Flux fine-tuning is an upstream hypothesis only.  Do not claim it
    as the cause without a paired, same-input Flux-on/Flux-off ablation.
  - Cold Fix124 completed S0-S3 30/30, but the interrupted coordinator did not
    write a trustworthy combined end-to-end summary. Do not substitute S4 or
    cached supplement time for cold full-chain wall time.

